    trivia: ['"House" usually names a building. "Home" can also describe a place where you feel comfortable and connected to people. That is why Emma can call Kyoto home, not only her room at Kamo House.', 'house は通常、建物を指します。home は、安心でき、人とのつながりを感じる場所も表せます。だからエマはKamo Houseの自分の部屋だけでなく、京都も home と呼べるのです。'], triviaQuestion: ['Why does Emma call Kyoto home?', 'She feels comfortable and connected to her friends there.'],
